[143.723656, "o", "\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[143.760474, "o", "The Helpdesk's network, first-draft\r\n\r\n  VPC        10.20.0.0/16   (a private network: AWS gives it no way out by default)\r\n  subnet     10.20.1.0/24    us-east-1a  private\r\n  subnet     10.20.2.0/24    us-east-1b  private\r\n  subnet     10.20.100.0/24  us-east-1a  public\r\n  internet gateway  yes\r\n  NAT gateway       yes\r\n  private route table: 0.0.0.0/0 -> NAT gateway (the internet)\r\n"]
[143.760802, "o", "  VPC endpoint      com.amazonaws.us-east-1.bedrock-runtime  (Interface, private DNS on, policy DEFAULT)\r\n  endpoint accepts  port 443 from 10.20.0.0/16 (the whole VPC)\r\n\r\nA call to bedrock-runtime uses the endpoint (private DNS sends it there).\r\n"]
[143.760907, "o", "A call to bedrock-mantle has no endpoint: it goes out through the NAT gateway.\r\n"]
[143.766485, "o", "\u001b[?2004h\u001b]0;thesecguy@lab: ~/ai-security-course-labs/labs/m11\u0007\u001b[01;32mthesecguy@lab\u001b[00m:\u001b[01;34m~/ai-security-course-labs/labs/m11\u001b[00m$ "]
