[154.981277, "o", "The bedrock-runtime endpoint's policy, first-draft: aws_vpc_endpoint.bedrock_runtime (default policy)\r\n\r\n  Sid        (none)\r\n  Effect     Allow\r\n  Principal  *   (anyone, from any AWS account)\r\n  Action     *\r\n  Resource   *\r\n  Condition  (none)\r\n\r\nWho gets through this door? (endpoint policy only; IAM still has to allow the call too)\r\n"]
[154.98146, "o", "  THROUGH  arn:aws:iam::111122223333:role/tsg-helpdesk-app  (account 111122223333)\r\n  THROUGH  arn:aws:iam::111122223333:role/DataScienceRole  (account 111122223333)\r\n  THROUGH  arn:aws:iam::777788889999:user/personal-admin  (account 777788889999)\r\n"]
