[196.47488, "o", "\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[196.511185, "o", "What gets recorded, first-draft\r\n\r\nModel invocation logging (the prompt and the answer; bedrock-runtime calls only):\r\n  on, for: text, image, embedding, video   (for every model in this account and Region)\r\n  to CloudWatch Logs group /tsg-helpdesk/bedrock/model-invocations\r\n  bodies over 100 KB: nowhere (no S3 bucket set)\r\n  stored in /tsg-helpdesk/bedrock/model-invocations (no KMS key of yours, kept FOREVER)\r\n\r\nCloudTrail (who called what, from where; never the prompt):\r\n  event history: management events such as InvokeModel and Converse, 90 days, free, always on\r\n  trail: NONE, so no data events (bedrock-mantle inference) and no network activity events\r\n"]
[196.516909, "o", "\u001b[?2004h\u001b]0;thesecguy@lab: ~/ai-security-course-labs/labs/m11\u0007\u001b[01;32mthesecguy@lab\u001b[00m:\u001b[01;34m~/ai-security-course-labs/labs/m11\u001b[00m$ "]
